    "media_with_text_WxXCka": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_jcxGDt": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Our Values & Vision",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_zB4R7W": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kremp Florist & Flower Delivery is a provider of floral, gift and home decor items utilizing all forms of marketing.  In all areas, only the highest standards of honesty and integrity are conveyed to assure the satisfaction of our customers, our florist partners and our co-workers.  We work to exceed expectations by offering simple and seamless ordering, timely delivery and beautiful products.  </p><p>Kremp Florist & Flower Delivery plans to grow in all areas including floral, weddings, events and gifts.  Improvements in technology will allow us to continue to offer the highest quality customer service.  We will also continue to explore and provide new product lines in gift, edible and non-floral items.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_jcxGDt",
        "text_zB4R7W"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "is_award": false,
        "coordinates": "",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/values_vision.jpg",
        "video_external": "",
        "video_description": "",
