    "media_with_text_wkaVWB": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_KbjjYB": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Our History",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "text_rX3Anw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>For three generations, and over 60 years, we have been helping people in Philadelphia and the surrounding suburbs such as Abington, Doylestown, Jenkintown, Horsham, Hatboro, Southampton, Huntingdon Valley and many others, convey their very special feelings. Service, quality, and that something extra have given our company success. Our nearly 60 employees are committed to your satisfaction and all of our products are unconditionally guaranteed.</p><p>Kremp Florist & Flower Delivery prides itself on its versatility and complete commitment to pleasing every customer. From our talented wedding department to our experienced sympathy and funeral design department, we are a full service florist with talented designers who create arrangements to satisfy any taste. Whether it's a gift of roses for Valentine's Day, a traditional, exotic, natural/outdoorsy, romantic or artistic design, we will combine our products in a way that will exceed your expectations. We have an extensive gift line including balloons, silk and dried flowers, greeting cards, Sweet Shop truffles and chocolates, Willow Tree Figurines, Tea Forte teas, Gianna Rose soaps, Bath & body products, Webkinz, wine and gourmet food gifts, Northern Lights Candles, Woodwick Candle and an extensive line of unique gift baskets. Our website offerings are representative of what we can do for you, but our ability to create custom arrangements to any specifications means our selection is limitless.</p><p>Kremp Florist & Flower Delivery and owner Charles F Kremp 3rd were selected by the Society of American Florists to oversee the US Presidential inaugurations in 1989, 1993, 2001 and 2005.  Kremp Florist & Flower Delivery has been ranked a top 20 florist in the United States by multiple floral wire services and won the award for National Retail Florist of the Year, the highest honor in the floral industry.  Kremp Florist & Flower Delivery has been featured on ABC's television show the Goldbergs many times and was the selected florist for decorations and floral displays at the US Open at Merion Golf Club in 2013.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_KbjjYB",
        "text_rX3Anw"
      ],
